      "content": "i dont want a new plot. i don't want a memoir. i'm just tired. there's no more soil to prepare, the ground is just frozen. it feels heavy, the weight of just... existing for no reason. it feels like i'm just taking up space that could be used for something that actually matters. isn't there some kind of dignity in knowing when you've reached the end of your usefulness?",
